[2021-08-24T21:51:02+08:00][sql] UPDATE `carver_article`  SET `article_id` = 44 , `article_title` = '科普一下 LB（负载均衡）技术' , `article_desc` = '科普一下 LB（负载均衡）技术' , `article_content` = '<h2 data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px; max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mngWTkJEOYKp4UQiaSvVlls60Jia8qqFiaN1bFrt4lxkH2DBg3OqfSx76f6DjvpWCUn2iaavZpKW26AxBJh53tzPHw/640?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-position: center center; background-size: 50px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: black; text-align: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 38px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; display: inline-block; height: 38px; line-height: 42px; color: rgb(72, 179, 120); background-position: left center; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-size: 63px; font-size: 18px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">负载均衡</span></h2><h3 data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px; max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: black; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px 0px -1px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mngWTkJEOYKp4UQiaSvVlls60Jia8qqFiaNvVygk5yvwjpIalNWvWNk3fZGuljulgicQOOOOqJ6rEwYTPtMRg776VA/640?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-size: 100% 100%; background-repeat: no-repeat; display: inline-block; width: 16px; height: 15px; line-height: 15px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; display: inline-block; color: rgb(72, 179, 120); overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">介绍</span></h3><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">假如我们刚刚上线一个网站，最多只有 10 个人同时访问，那么只需要把网站放到一台服务器上就够了，又叫&nbsp;<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">单机部署</strong>&nbsp;：</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" data-filename=\"微信图片_20210824210907.jpg\" style=\"width: 25%; float: none;\"><br></p><figure data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></figure><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">随着我们网站的不断宣传，可能出现上万用户同时访问的情况。由于一台服务器的 CPU、内存、带宽等资源都是有限的，无法同时支撑那么多用户。因此可能需要多台服务器一起来扛，分摊用户的请求，你一半我一半，又叫&nbsp;<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">集群部署</strong>：</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"width: 300px;\" data-filename=\"微信图片_20210824211022.jpg\"><br></p><figure data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></figure><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">但这样有个问题，每个服务器都有一个不同的 IP 地址，想把用户的请求分摊到不同的服务器上，总不能让用户自己去输入不同的 IP 访问吧？</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">因此，我们还需要一台&nbsp;<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">代理服务器</strong>&nbsp;，对外提供&nbsp;<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">唯一</strong>&nbsp;的入口，<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">统一</strong>&nbsp;接受用户的请求。再根据请求（或流量）的&nbsp;<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">特征</strong>&nbsp;，依据一定的&nbsp;<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">算法</strong>&nbsp;，将请求转发到内部的服务器集群中，如图：</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"width: 648px;\" data-filename=\"微信图片_20210824211112.jpg\"><br></p><figure data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></figure><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">这样对于用户来说，始终通过一个域名访问网站即可，他完全感知不到你的网站到底部署到多少台服务器上、也不关心它是如何部署的。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">这便是&nbsp;<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">负载均衡</strong>（Load Balancing 简称 LB），是企业中最重要的高并发解决方案之一。</p><h4 data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: black; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">作用</h4><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">负载均衡最直观的作用就是提高系统的并发度，说人话就是允许更多人同时访问了。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">它还可以提高整个系统的可用性，假如集群中有一台服务器挂了，代理服务器只要不再把请求转发给它就行了，集群中的其他服务器仍然能够正常地接受和处理请求。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">此外，负载均衡还能够减少用户等待响应的时间、通过并行提高整个系统的处理能力等。</p><figure data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></figure><h3 data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px; max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: black; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px 0px -1px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mngWTkJEOYKp4UQiaSvVlls60Jia8qqFiaNvVygk5yvwjpIalNWvWNk3fZGuljulgicQOOOOqJ6rEwYTPtMRg776VA/640?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-size: 100% 100%; background-repeat: no-repeat; display: inline-block; width: 16px; height: 15px; line-height: 15px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; display: inline-block; color: rgb(72, 179, 120); overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">分类</span></h3><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">虽然通过代理服务器转发请求能够提升整个系统的并发访问数，但不要忘了，代理服务器本身的资源也是有限的啊！像比较常用的 Nginx 代理，能有个几万并发就撑死了。如果同时访问的用户量再大一点，不就忍不下了么？！</p><figure data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></figure><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">而且代理服务器也存在挂掉的可能性，一旦它挂了，后果不堪设想。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">因此，我们可以将负载均衡进行分类，针对不同的场景来选择相对合适的实现方式。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">比较常见的分类方法是：根据&nbsp;<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">计算机网络七层模型</strong>&nbsp;，按照负载均衡所属的网络层次去区分。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">下面这张计算机网络模型图还是很棒的：</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"width: 831px;\" data-filename=\"微信图片_20210824211248.jpg\"><br></p><figure data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><figcaption style=\"margin: 5px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-align: center; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 12px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">计算机网络模型</figcaption></figure><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">有关计算机网络的知识非本文重点，大家可以自行去了解，不懂也没关系，可以接着往下看。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">无论是哪层负载均衡，都需要有代理服务器，并且对外提供唯一的 IP 地址，然后根据算法将请求转发到目标服务器（实际处理请求的服务器）。只不过实现转发的原理和逻辑不同罢了。</p><h4 data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: black; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">二层负载均衡</h4><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">二层指数据链路层，数据以数据帧的形式通过交换机进行传输。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">这一层是没有 IP 地址概念的，只能用 MAC 地址对机器进行区分。因此负载均衡服务器会通过一个虚拟 MAC 地址接受请求，并通过改写报文目标 MAC 地址的方式将请求转发到具有不同 MAC 地址的目标机器。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"width: 728px;\" data-filename=\"微信图片_20210824211458.jpg\"><br></p><figure data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></figure><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">二层负载均衡最原始、性能极高。但只能通过硬件设备实现，比如 F5、Array 等，价格十分昂贵。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">主要的底层实现方式就是 PPP 捆绑和链路聚合技术，这里不做赘述，对于开发同学来说，大家一般也接触不到二层负载均衡。</p><h4 data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: black; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">三层负载均衡</h4><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">三层即网络层，这一层开始有了 IP 地址的概念，可以根据 IP 地址路由网络。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">这一层的负载均衡设备会对外提供一个虚拟的 IP 地址（VIP）以接收请求，然后根据算法将请求转发到 IP 地址不同的目标机器。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"width: 676px;\" data-filename=\"微信图片_20210824211545.jpg\"><br></p><figure data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></figure><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">和二层一样，三层负载均衡也是通过硬件设备实现，成本也比较高。</p><h4 data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: black; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">四层负载均衡</h4><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">四层即传输层，除了包含三层的 IP 地址信息之外，还多了源目端口号的概念，可以区分同一机器上不同的应用。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">由于得到了更多的信息，这一层的负载均衡会更加灵活，对外提供一个虚拟的 IP 地址 + 端口号来接收请求，然后根据算法将请求转发到不同目标机器的不同端口上。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"width: 704px;\" data-filename=\"微信图片_20210824211616.jpg\"><br></p><figure data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></figure><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">四层负载均衡可以通过软件实现，比如主流且开源的 LVS（Linux Virtual Server），底层可选多种负载模式，比如 NAT（网络地址转换）、DR（直接路由）、TUN（隧道）。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">四层负载均衡的优点是：一方面是性能很高、比较稳定，支撑个十几万、几十万并发不成问题；另一方面是成本低、纯软件实现，因此在企业中的应用很广泛。</p><h4 data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: black; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">七层负载均衡</h4><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">七层指应用层，是计算机网络模型的最上层，因此能得到请求最为详细的信息，比如 HTTP 请求头等。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">可以根据域名或主机 IP + 端口接收请求，并通过应用层信息（请求头、Cookie 等）灵活地转发请求，比如将手机端用户转发到服务器 A、桌面端用户转发到服务器 B 等。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"width: 680px;\" data-filename=\"微信图片_20210824211639.jpg\"><br></p><figure data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></figure><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">这种方式实现成本最低，也最为灵活，因此也是我们应用开发人员最常用的了。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">实现方式多种多样，比如主流的 Nginx、HAProxy 都可以，写个配置基本就能转发请求了，大部分情况下性能也够用了。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">再提一下所属于这层的&nbsp;<code style=\"margin: 0px 2px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); font-family: &quot;Operator Mono&quot;, Consolas, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(40, 202, 113); overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">DNS 负载均衡</code>&nbsp;，基于 DNS 域名解析服务，可以将同一个域名解析为不同的 IP 地址，从而让用户访问到不同服务器上的项目。</p><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">这种方式实现起来不难，但转发逻辑不够灵活，而且 DNS &nbsp;存在缓存，不利于修改。<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></p><hr data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 1px; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-top-color: initial; text-align: center; background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(93, 186, 133, 0), rgba(93, 186, 133, 0.75), rgba(93, 186, 133, 0)); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><p data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"padding-top: 1em; padding-bottom: 8px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">除了上面讲到的这些，负载均衡还有很多学问，比如负载均衡算法（比如常用的静态轮询、动态连接数等）、高可用等，这些大家自行了解和实践下就好了，具体场景具体分析。</p><figure data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></figure>' , `article_guide` = 5 , `article_label` = 'php' , `article_img` = '/uploads/20210824/b5527ea0fd9bf99f20d64b576d914c0f.jpeg' , `is_show` = 1 , `click_num` = 256 , `is_top_show` = 0 , `update_time` = 1629813062  WHERE  `article_id` = 44 [ RunTime:0.017666s ]
